<title>INDIA: Stocks which moved India's BSE Index - Feb 5.</title>
<headline>Stocks which moved India's BSE Index - Feb 5.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following is an analysis of the 30-share Bombay Stock Exchange (BSE) index movement on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The table shows the stocks which moved the index most during the day (upto 0650 GMT)and their percentage contribution to the net change.</p>
<p>The index at (0650 GMT) was 3401.24, 23.61 points or 0.70 percent higher than Tuesday's close.</p>
